    <string name="dashboard_help_title">How to mount network drive?</string>
    <string name="dashboard_help_desc">1. Connect your PC to the same Wi-Fi network.\n2. On macOS Finder: Press Cmd+K, type %1$s and connect.\n3. On Windows 11 Explorer: Select \'Map Network Drive\', enter %1$s\n\n⚠️ Windows WebDAV HTTP Tweak:\nWindows requires a registry setting to mount WebDAV over unencrypted HTTP (Basic Authentication).\nModify registry value \'BasicAuthLevel\' to 2 under WebClient parameters.</string>

